# Accepted Trivy findings — each with the reason. Review when the
# relevant file changes.

# DS-0002 (no non-root USER) — apps/web/Dockerfile only. That image never
# serves anything: it runs once to copy the built static files into the
# shared, root-owned web_static volume that nginx serves, then exits. As
# a non-root user the copy would fail and nginx would keep serving the
# old build. The API image does run as a non-root user.
DS-0002
AVD-DS-0002
